### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(e^{^{\Large\frac{1}{x}}}\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=\dfrac{1}{x}\text{, }v(x)=e^x}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{e^{^{\Large\frac{1}{x}}}}\left(\maroonC{-\dfrac{1}{x^2}}\right)
\\\\
&=-\dfrac{e^{^{\Large\frac{1}{x}}}}{x^2}
\end{align}$
